t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>On Day One, President Donald J. Trump</strong> <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/2025/01/the-inaugural-address/\"><strong>promised</strong></a> <strong>to “move with purpose and speed to bring back hope, prosperity, safety, and peace.”</strong> Nearly two years into his second term, he has done exactly that — delivering results at a pace Washington has never seen.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Here are 32 landmark policy wins from the past few weeks alone:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>President Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/09/president-trump-takes-historic-action-to-eliminate-wasteful-and-harmful-spending/\">clawed back</a> nearly $1 billion in wasteful spending aimed at illegal aliens and DEI programs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of State <a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/us/state-department-revokes-250000-visas-broad-immigration-vetting-crackdown\">surpassed</a> 250,000 visa revocations, tightening vetting and removing criminal illegal aliens.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>President Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/09/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-streamlines-access-to-government-services-through-america-gov/\">launched</a> America.gov, a first-of-its-kind platform putting government services and information directly in Americans’ hands.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>President Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/mined-melted-and-poured-in-america-president-trump-reverses-years-of-anti-mining-policy/\">secured</a> a $15 billion Iowa steel mill set to add $95 billion to the economy, produce up to 10 million tons of steel per year, and create thousands of permanent jobs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of the Treasury <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/30/obamacare-aca-refund-checks.html\">began</a> sending Obamacare refund checks to nearly one million Americans who were overcharged under the Biden Administration.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of the Treasury <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/01/treasury-trump-accounts-auto-enroll-more-than-60-million-children.html\">announced</a> that more than 60 million children have been automatically enrolled in Trump Accounts.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of the Treasury <a href=\"https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sb0636/\">sanctioned</a> 21 individuals and 25 companies tied to the Sinaloa Cartel.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Education formally <a href=\"https://www.ed.gov/about/news/press-release/us-department-of-education-formally-rescinds-biden-administrations-illegal-title-ix-rewrite-reinstating-2020-regulation?utm_source=NOTUS+Newsletter+Audience&amp;utm_campaign=df43448bd0-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2026_09_23_08_44&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_-df43448bd0-746235601&amp;mc_cid=df43448bd0&amp;mc_eid=f5c0c43bca\">rescinded</a> the Biden Administration’s illegal Title IX rewrite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Energy <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/articles/energy-department-announces-speed-power-investments-across-26-states-lower-electricity\">announced</a> nearly $2 billion for grid upgrades across the country.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Transportation <a href=\"https://www.transportation.gov/briefing-room/president-trump-transportation-secretary-duffy-finalize-freedom-means-affordable-cars\">finalized</a> new vehicle efficiency standards that will save Americans nearly $140 billion over five years.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Commerce <a href=\"https://www.wiwynn.com/news/wiwynn-strengthens-global-supply-chain-resilience-with-grand-opening-of-advanced-manufacturing-facility-in-texas?srsltid=AU7gw4VmtTNASfq1F27izYTfTHBKCILI_nAc7qw4PICAeZVrlHnhJUjT\">locked in</a> a $1.6 billion advanced manufacturing investment in Texas.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of State <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/africa/nigeria-us-sign-agreement-boost-mining-investment-2026-09-24/\">secured</a> a historic agreement to develop Nigeria’s $700 billion worth of mineral resources.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of State <a href=\"https://www.state.gov/releases/office-of-the-spokesman/2026/09/protecting-the-sanctity-of-u-s-citizenshipa-new-visa-restriction-policy-for-those-who-engage-in-or-facilitate-birth-tourism\">imposed</a> new visa restrictions to combat birth tourism and protect U.S. citizenship.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The White House budget office <a href=\"https://www.fiercepharma.com/pharma/white-house-inventories-us-capacity-ahead-plans-reshore-production-86-essential-medicines\">moved</a> to reshore production of 86 essential medicines, including penicillin, epinephrine, and ibuprofen.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Federal regulators <a href=\"https://www.argusmedia.com/en/news-and-insights/latest-market-news/2876304-ferc-approves-more-gas-pipelines-in-southeast-us\">authorized</a> the Kosciusko Junction pipeline to deliver an extra 1.2 billion cubic feet of natural gas per day to the Southeast.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of the Interior <a href=\"https://www.blm.gov/press-release/blm-oil-and-gas-lease-sale-utah-generates-nearly-45-million-revenue\">completed</a> a Utah oil and gas lease sale that brought in nearly $5 million, with Trump-era revenues already <a href=\"https://www.blm.gov/press-release/blms-second-quarter-2026-oil-and-gas-lease-sales-generate-41-billion\">exceeding</a> the entire Biden term.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Departments of Commerce and Energy <a href=\"https://naturalgasintel.com/news/eqt-expands-lng-reach-with-10-year-supply-deal-in-lithuania/\">secured</a> a ten-year LNG supply deal between Lithuania’s Ignitis and U.S. producer EQT.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of State <a href=\"https://investors.boeing.com/investors/news/press-release-details/2026/Biman-Bangladesh-Airlines-Orders-11-More-Boeing-Jets-to-Expand-Fleet/default.aspx\">facilitated</a> a landmark deal for Biman Bangladesh Airlines to purchase 11 additional Boeing aircraft.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of the Treasury <a href=\"https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/treasury-irs-issue-proposed-regulations-on-installment-payments-for-tax-on-certain-farmland-sales\">expanded</a> tax-payment flexibility for American farmers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Office of Personnel Management <a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/office-personnel-management-uncovers-500m-fraud-waste-federal-health-benefits-programs\">uncovered</a> $500 million in fraud and waste in federal health benefit programs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Medicare officials <a href=\"https://www.cms.gov/newsroom/press-releases/cms-cracks-down-fraud-waste-abuse-federal-health-insurance-marketplacer\">cancelled</a> 315,000 unauthorized Obamacare enrollments, saving taxpayers roughly $2.2 billion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Justice <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/dojs-fraud-division-uncovers-134m-stolen-social-security-benefits-one-month-takedown\">charged</a> 17 defendants in a $1.3 million Social Security fraud scheme.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Justice <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/justice-department-sues-minnesota-st-paul-and-minneapolis-over-firearm-purchase-waiting\">sued</a> the state of Minnesota and the cities of Minneapolis and Saint Paul over a gun scheme that violates the Second Amendment.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The EEOC <a href=\"https://www.eeoc.gov/newsroom/eeoc-defends-womens-rights-single-sex-spaces-work-illinois\">resolved</a> a case against a municipal employer that refused to protect women’s single-sex spaces.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Health officials <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/press-room/hhs-funds-tick-control-research-lyme-disease-alpha-gal-syndrome.html\">awarded</a> $3 million to develop new ways to cut tick populations and fight Lyme and alpha-gal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Export-Import Bank <a href=\"https://mercuria.com/mercuria-commits-500-million-to-vaultco-u-s-critical-mineral-stockpile-in-partnership-with-the-u-s-export-import-bank/\">secured</a> a $500 million private commitment to build a U.S. Strategic Critical Minerals Reserve.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of War <a href=\"https://www.washingtontimes.com/news/2026/sep/28/pete-hegseth-memo-lays-pentagon-plan-protect-elections-foreign/?srsltid=AU7gw4WRJrQox2c8DnCl8OHbQl5PujY2RqDY1DuxvOqiZT32yxroQErU\">unveiled</a> a plan to protect the 2026 midterm elections from foreign interference.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of War <a href=\"https://www.dailywire.com/news/exclusive-war-department-raises-hazard-pay-for-first-time-in-two-decades\">raised</a> hazard pay for U.S. service members for the first time in over two decades.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of War <a href=\"https://www.rtx.com/news/news-center/2026/09/28/rtxs-raytheon-awarded-20-7-billion-multi-year-contract-for-amraam-under-landmar\">awarded</a> a historic $20.7 billion contract to surge domestic missile production. </li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of War <a href=\"https://www.war.gov/News/News-Stories/Article/Article/4607679/military-spouse-commission-holds-first-meeting-identifies-top-issues/\">convened</a> the first Military Spouse Commission meeting at the White House to improve life for military families.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Coast Guard <a href=\"https://www.dhs.gov/news/2026/09/24/us-coast-guard-surpasses-260000-total-pounds-cocaine-seized-operation-pacific-viper\">seized</a> more than 260,000 pounds of cocaine under Operation Pacific Viper.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Department of Energy and the Department of War <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/nnsa/articles/nnsa-and-joint-interagency-task-force-401-strengthen-partnership-counter-drone\">signed</a> an agreement to strengthen joint defenses against drone threats.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>President Trump’s Memphis Safe Task Force <a href=\"https://www.usmarshals.gov/news/press-release/memphis-safe-task-force-commemorates-first-year-of-relentless-action-against\">surpassed</a> 13,100 criminal arrests and 2,200 illegal gun seizures, while his D.C. Safe and Beautiful Task Force neared 18,000 arrests and more than 2,100 illegal gun seizures.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>First Lady Melania Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/09/adobe-amazon-intel-starlink-google-and-zoom-partner-with-first-lady-melania-trumps-fostering-the-future-together/\">secured</a> partnerships with Adobe, Amazon, Intel, Starlink, Google, and Zoom to expand technology and education for children through her Fostering the Future Together initiative.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From reshoring critical industries and cutting waste to crushing crime and protecting taxpayers, President Trump is delivering the agenda Americans elected him to pursue — and he’s not slowing down.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/nearly-two-years-in-president-trump-is-still-stacking-historic-wins-at-record-speed/\">Nearly Two Years In, President Trump Is Still Stacking Historic Wins at Record Speed</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
